        "text": "={{ $json.body.message }}\n",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "=you are supposed to Analyze this lead and provide a json response for score, tier,source, insights, red flag and suggested action. \n* Define the source from where the lead is generating.\n* If the leads fall in hot so give suggestion to immediate contact or schedule demo and so on.\n* Also provide red flag if emails seems to be a spam or promotional.\n\nFllow this exact sructure:\n\n  score: (number 1-10),\n  tier: (\"hot\" if 8-10, \"warm\" if 5-7, \"cold\" if 1-4),\n  source: (\"webhook\")\n  insights: array of 2-3 key observations, described each in 2 words,\n  suggested_action: \"specific advice for sales rep\"\n  red flag: \"if any\"\n"
        }
      },
